Hello again, I was just playing around with Alpha 2, with the same code snippet, the fat arrow indentation appears fixed but the class indentation seems to remain indented 1 level too deep.

**Before**

```js
class Klass {
    constructor() {
        const nameKlass = (name) => {
            this.name = name;
        };
        nameKlass('Klass');
    }
}
```

**After**

```js
class Klass
    { // This shouldn't be indented
    constructor()
    {
        const nameKlass = (name) =>
        {
            this.name = name;
        };

        nameKlass('Klass');
    }
}
```

Perhaps I really am doing something wrong
